B.wS=new A.bL(B.QA,["Now","Next","Adhan","Iqamath","Subah","Sunrise","Luhar","Jum'ah","Asr","Magrib","Isha",B.is,B.lS,B.fw,B.qC,"for Adhan","for Iqamath","passed Iqamath","Tarawih","Settings","Home Settings","Iqamath, masjid name, zone, background and clock","Hijri Calendar","Prayer Times","View prayer times for the entire month","No data available","Date","Dark Theme","Light Theme","Toggle between dark and light theme","Background Style","Default","Morphine Glass","Ocean Depth","Forest Mist","Clock Style","Digital Clock","Analog Clock","Hil\u0101l Calendar","Islamic lunar calendar based on moon sighting","Show ACJU Hijri Day","On the Home screen, the next day begins after Maghrib (except on the 29th).","Show full Hijri date (day, month, year)","Show Hijri month and year only","Hijri date is based on ACJU moon sighting (acju.lk)","Requires internet connection.","Preview","Day + Month + Year","Month + Year","Retry","OK","No internet connection","Failed to load calendar","Error","Background Reliability","Disable to prevent missed alarms & notifications","Check","\u2705 Already exempted from battery optimization","Important",'If you miss prayer alarms or notifications:\n1. Disable battery optimization above\n2. In phone Settings \u2192 Apps \u2192 Success Call Display \u2192 allow "Autostart" & "Background activity"\n3. For Xiaomi/MIUI: Security \u2192 Permissions \u2192 Autostart \u2192 Enable Success Call Display',"Zone","Masjidh","Select Masjidh","Notifications","Enable prayer time notifications","Notification Sound","Select notification sound","Default","Adhan (Short)","Adhan (Full)","Notify Tone","Silent (Notification only)","Notifications enabled","Notifications disabled","Enable/disable all prayer notifications","Configure notifications for each prayer individually",u.B,"Notification enabled","Notification disabled","Sound","Sound Preview","Short beep sound","Adhan sound","Troubleshooting","Notifications not working?","\u2022 Allow app in battery optimization settings",'\u2022 Select "No restrictions" or "Unrestricted"',"\u2022 Ensure notification permissions are granted","Notification permission not granted. Permission is required for notifications to work.","Allow Notifications","Never miss a prayer","Get a gentle reminder at the start of each prayer time, even when the app is closed.","Notify me at prayer times","Not now","Language","Select Language","Adhan","Adhan in","Iqamath","Iqamath in","Iqamath times are fixed for this mosque","Iqamath Times","Show Iqamath times","Display Iqamath times below Adhan in the prayer list","Iqamath display","Hide","Adhan only with larger text","Always show","Show Adhan and Iqamath together","Slide on interval","Slide top to bottom between Adhan only and Iqamath only (large text)","Configure Masjidh Iqamath Times","Configure {name} Iqamath Times","Set the minutes between Adhan and Iqamath for each prayer of your nearest masjidh","Set the minutes between Adhan and Iqamath for each prayer of {name}","minutes","Scheduling Notifications...","Please Wait","Select Zone","Select Your Zone","Choose your zone for accurate prayer times","Continue","About The App","Selected Zone","Your Trusted Prayer Time Companion","Free App","About The App","Success Call Display is a comprehensive prayer time application designed to provide accurate prayer times for Muslims in Sri Lanka. With precise prayer times, iqamah timings, and notifications, it helps you stay on track with your daily prayers.","Features","Accurate ACJU prayer times for all zones in Sri Lanka","Zone selection based on your location","Multi-language support (English, Tamil, Sinhala & Arabic)","Beautiful dark and light themes","Completely free with no ads","ACJU Hijri calendar","100% offline after initial setup","Iqamah time can be customized based on the nearest masjid","Monthly prayer time view","Available on Android, Web & Windows","Customizable background themes & gradient wallpapers","Live digital clock with Hijri date display","Masjid display mode for wall screens & TVs","13 features \u2022 tap to explore","Developer","Software Engineer","Contact","Support","Platform Links","Android, Web, Windows \u2022 tap to view","Web Version","Android App","Visit Web Version","Download Android App","For issues, suggestions, or feedback, please reach out via whatsapp/email. We value your feedback!","Donate","If you would like to support the Success Call Display app, you can donate securely via PayPal.","Get in Touch","Have feedback, found a bug, or wish to donate? Reach out directly on WhatsApp \u2014 we'd love to hear from you!","Contact via WhatsApp","Copied to clipboard","Open","Copy","Close","Credits","Special thanks to the Department of Muslim Religious Affairs, Sri Lanka, and all those who made the Success Call Display app possible.","Prayer times are based on ACJU data Updated from acju.lk","Updated from acju.lk","Old prayer times are sourced from mDisplay old data","Prayer Time Adjustment","Adjust Prayer Times","Fine-tune prayer times in minutes to match your location. Positive values delay the time, negative values advance it.","Adjustment range: -30 to +30 minutes","No adjustment","\u2705 Adjustments saved successfully","Current Adjustments","Reset All","Cancel","Save Changes","Back","Next","Finish","Select Your Language","Choose your preferred language for the app","Enter Masjidh Name","Enter the name of your masjid","Masjid Name","e.g. Masjidhul Hasanath","Please enter a masjid name","Edit Masjid Name","Show masjid name on home","Display the masjid name on the top left of the clock","Show zone","Display the selected zone below the Hijri date","Show next prayer","Show the Next / prayer name / countdown row above Adhan time","Show next prayer border","Show the border around the next prayer panel","Show AM/PM","Show AM/PM next to prayer times","Embossed digit style","Show large time digits with a 3D embossed effect","Show Hijri date","Show the Hijri date on the home clock","Show silent mode icon","Display silent mode icon on home screen clock","Choose your prayer time zone","Data Source","Prayer Times","Old Prayer Times","Prayer Time Zones","Old Prayer Time Zones","Error completing setup","Auto-start on boot","Opens the app after restart to show prayer times and reschedule notifications","Masjid display mode","Auto-opens after power cut and shows prayer times. Keeps screen on. No notifications.","Always on for TV and wall displays","Open Settings","Permission not granted. Please enable it and try again.","Permission granted!","Battery Optimization","For notifications to work reliably when the app is closed, please disable battery optimization for this app.","Skip","Disable Optimization","Reset","Save All Changes","Iqamah times saved successfully","zones","Select Month","Reset App","Clear all settings and restart","Reset App","This will clear all settings and return to onboarding. Continue?","Cancel","Reset","{manufacturer} device detected","Devices from this manufacturer aggressively kill background apps. To ensure notifications work properly, follow the steps below.","Open App Settings","Steps for your device:","The dua to recite abundantly upon attaining Laylatul Qadr night","Dua","Transliteration",u.F,"Meaning","O Allah, You are Most Forgiving, and You love forgiveness, so forgive me."],t.yf)
